=> Two causes, both structural (NOT a coarse noise range):
   (i) delay/energy eliminate deep layers before privacy is considered;
   (ii) ReLU clamps negatives to zero, removing ~half the injected noise,
        so post-ReLU (and pooling) split points dominate conv split points.

